note store/mvgrowth.om: the store build's seam for growth/ (defines the names of server/nogrowth.om).
note /trending and /trending.json answer the 503 of store/moving.om; every other address growth
note reads (explore?order=, insights) is answered as without growth.
text tmvtr "/trending"
text tmvtrj "/trending.json"
fn grroute to long
if or fpeq tmvtr fpeq tmvtrj
ret mvans
end
ret 0
end
note grorder: what fpgone and fpgroot ask first (the one-segment pages): the same as grroute
fn grorder to long
ret grroute
end
